{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iw3rkQ0lzz1792737170.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產逸濤灣分行高級分區營業經理柯冠豐表示，分行新近促成西灣河The Holborn租賃成交，單位為B座中層B5室，實用面積255平方呎，採1房間隔，向西南，景觀開揚，最新以18,300元租出，折合實用呎租71.8元。<br/>柯冠豐表示，新租客為內地專業人士，為方便上班，遂決定承租上址。據悉，業主於2023年以623萬元購入單位，持貨3年，是次出租可享3.5厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.790664+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:58:09.408019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:12.300824+00:00","content_hash":"c4414554b9fa096853818ed5acbf0a1b554e6cde104b537748144c89e3aedf7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.790664+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}